#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_signin_panel.html.twig
msgid "After the right password, a 6-digit PIN goes to the email of the login, and signing in needs it. It works once, for 10 minutes. Clients who sign in with an authenticator app or with Google are not asked. \"Trust this browser for 30 days\" skips the PIN on a known browser until the password changes."
